          "Do not assume 72% is a durable mandate: this margin is held by specific alignment with younger, educated, renter-heavy constituencies evaluating on economic security and housing policy — not a broad party alignment. Any candidate who takes this coalition for granted without actively tending to material economic concerns will find the margin vulnerable in a competitive cycle."
