          "Invest in younger adult economic opportunity and retention: the 25.5% college attainment rate reflects a district where young people with educational credentials often leave for urban labor markets; specific attention to workforce development, agricultural succession planning, and rural broadband that enables remote work can prevent the slow demographic erosion that undermines even safe rural seats over time."
