          "Manage generational transition risk: the 46.8-year median age and 83.1% homeowner rate mean this district's electoral foundation is aging. Whether younger families are moving in or moving out, and whether they remain aligned with the incumbent's record, is a medium-term sustainability question. Monitor demographic trends carefully and remain attentive to whether the next generation of HD-5A voters perceives the incumbent as responsive to their interests or as entrenched in older voter preferences."
