          "Lead with the homeowner-and-middle-income majority's economic stability concerns: property tax fairness, rural infrastructure investment, healthcare access at $63,028 income, and agricultural/small-business viability are the material issues that sustain the 75% coalition, and staying responsive to these concerns is the foundation of holding the seat.",
