          "Engage aging homeowner material concerns with specificity: the 17.6% renter rate means 82.4% own homes, many on fixed incomes in a region where costs are rising faster than incomes; Medicare access, property tax management, and rural hospital viability are not abstract policy issues but direct household budget realities.",
          "Avoid treating 60-40 as a durable landslide: a 40% opposition share in a demographically homogeneous rural district is not normal partisan weakness but a signal that constituent satisfaction is conditional on effective incumbent performance; complacency on rural economic service delivery is the primary path to competitive challenge.",
