          "Maintain incumbent advantage by demonstrating government competence on local infrastructure and service delivery — a wealthy, educated constituency has high expectations for municipal effectiveness; visible delivery on roads, utilities, parks, and responsive local governance prevents the opposition from gaining traction on a 'government competence' frame that might otherwise appeal to tax-conscious voters."
